# SuperTuxKart's per-frame, 42-stage render profile. Roughly 4 MB per run and
# 90 MB per benchmark session -- 98% of what a benchmark directory weighs. A
# fresh run leaves it beside the other artifacts, where it is useful to anyone
# chasing a particular render stage; it is simply never committed. The summary,
# the frame counts and the GPU telemetry are what the findings rest on, and
# those come to under 2 MB per session.
benchmarks/**/stdout.log.profile-*.csv
__pycache__/
